:Script TcSayColumn1
:Synopsis Says column 2 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 2 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn2
:Synopsis Says column 3 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 3 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn3
:Synopsis Says column 4 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 4 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn4
:Synopsis Says column 5 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 5 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn5
:Synopsis Says column 6 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 6 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn6
:Synopsis Says column 7 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 7 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn7
:Synopsis Says column 8 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 8 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn8
:Synopsis Says column 9 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 9 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayColumn9
:Synopsis Says column 10 of the item in the file list
:Description Says column 10 of the file or folder in focus (the columns after the name), in the order Total Commander shows them.

:Script TcSayPath
:Synopsis Says the path of the active panel
:Description Says the path of the active Total Commander panel. Pressed twice quickly, copies the path to the clipboard.

:Script TcSayActivePanel
:Synopsis Says the active panel
:Description Says which Total Commander panel is active (left or right, as Total Commander names it).
